% Scenario: nested forms. The outer form's procedure executes the
% inner form: the outer resource contains a placement of the inner one
% (in outer form space), and the page carries one placement of the
% outer form.
/Inner << /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 60 60] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 0 0]
  /PaintProc { pop 0 0 60 60 rectfill } >> def
/Outer << /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 100 100] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 0 0]
  /PaintProc { pop 20 30 translate Inner execform } >> def
200 200 translate
Outer execform
showpage
